<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>"In any case, what we should focus on here is what happened when I, Haruka Niimura, went to the Arata settlement."<PG>
"That is to say, something happened to Haruka Niimura, who came down the mountain from the mountain seclusion for the first time in 2 years."<PG>
"This arc has one scenario left. 
{PAUSE ""}
If I recall correctly, at the end of this route, Haruka Niimura moved to the Arata settlement, and after that, contact with Natsumi Kogori and the others was cut off."<PG>
"Then, 2 years later, on Shiyo 802, April 8, I believe it ended with Natsumi Kogori and Erina Goto setting out for the Arata settlement to look for Haruka Niimura."<PG>
"Shiyo 802, April 8; Haruka Niimura, who had gone to the Arata settlement; and no way of reaching her."<PG>
"The conditions do seem similar."<PG>
"Perhaps we may learn what happened to Haruka Niimura."<PG>
"If I recall, there was talk of touching the 'Blessing' or some such. Perhaps we may learn about that 'Blessing' as well."<PG>
"Before going on to the last scenario, it may also be a good idea to review whatever was unclear in the References obtained so far."<PG>
"Now then, let us go. It will be all right. I am sure we can reach the truth."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日お辞儀.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
